#
# Provides the ColorPalette class representing a named collection of hex color
# values. Palettes typically contain 5-6 harmonious colors and are used for
# themed color schemes such as complementary, triadic, analogous, or custom
# curated palettes. Supports building palettes incrementally via method chaining
# or from a pre-existing list of colors.
